  "description": "Taking input from our team riders and constantly manufacturing and testing new prototypes has kept all of the MISFIT bikes ahead of the pack for years. The foundation of the MISFIT line has been dialed in geometry and dimensions that are well proportioned. To improve on the already popular 18” bike for 2026, we’ve lightened up the frame and added a CNC machined Integrated headtube with threaded Gyro holes. We also lightened up the fork and reduced the rake to 31mm while adding a welded insert for headset tensioning. With more and more 18” bikes hitting the streets we’ve upgraded the rear axle to a larger and wider 14mm X 170mm model for peg use. Our MISFIT 18 was designed and built to Ride Everything.",
